{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2113025450108715008"]}, "author_id": "1345044512624807937", "created_at": "2026-10-21T22:00:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113027774839480744"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 177, "id": "10228272", "start": 169, "username": "YouTube"}], "urls": [{"description": "Everyone promises sodium-ion. Who can actually deliver?There is n...", "display_url": "youtu.be/IuDcmrYbZik?si…", "end": 163, "expanded_url": "https://youtu.be/IuDcmrYbZik?si=hfLdBWX_B4INhZWd", "images": [{"height": 720, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113015335615893504/PeZtUuN-?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113015335615893504/PeZtUuN-?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 140, "status": 200, "title": "Everyone Promises Sodium-Ion. Who Can Actually Deliver?", "unwound_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?si=hfLdBWX_B4INhZWd&v=IuDcmrYbZik&feature=youtu.be", "url": "https://t.co/d3MHu8Uauk"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/TfENCxbSf7", "end": 201, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/DeutscherHase/status/2113027774839480744/video/1", "media_key": "13_2113025450108715008", "start": 178, "url": "https://t.co/TfENCxbSf7"}]}, "id": "2113027774839480744", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 73, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Everything you need to know about Sodium-ion commercialization outside China.   Everyone Promises Sodium-Ion. But Who Can Actually Deliver? https://t.co/d3MHu8Uauk via\n\n@YouTube https://t.co/TfENCxbSf7", "url": "https://x.com/DeutscherHase/status/2113027774839480744"}, {"author_id": "281321539", "created_at": "2026-10-23T05:27:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113502553598288360"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 280, "start": 271, "tag": "SIEW2026"}], "urls": [{"description": "This link will take you to a page that’s not on LinkedIn", "display_url": "lnkd.in/g8ZZhQw6", "end": 270, "expanded_url": "https://lnkd.in/g8ZZhQw6", "start": 247, "status": 200, "title": "LinkedIn", "unwound_url": "https://lnkd.in/g8ZZhQw6", "url": "https://t.co/WF2Yvmc0Dl"}]}, "id": "2113502553598288360", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The ASEAN Power Grid requires a transition from physical infrastructure development to unified regional regulatory coordination. Enhanced regional grid interconnection could enable renewable energy to supply over 70% of ASEAN's power mix by 2050.\nhttps://t.co/WF2Yvmc0Dl\n#SIEW2026", "url": "https://x.com/ESI_EnergyVibes/status/2113502553598288360"}, {"author_id": "1611906439521484801", "created_at": "2026-10-23T14:06:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113633181249282342"], "id": "2113633181249282342", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Most companies rent power. The winners own it. Grid interconnection takes 3-7 years in most US markets. Data centers build in 18 months. The developers building off-grid generation and battery storage aren't being clever. They're just the only ones on the right timeline.", "url": "https://x.com/grantbmcdaniel/status/2113633181249282342"}, {"author_id": "1801060257793183744", "created_at": "2026-10-22T16:05:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113300811325567117"], "id": "2113300811325567117", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2024's bottleneck was GPUs. 2026's bottleneck is the power grid — interconnection queues run 4-10 years now. the AI trade quietly became a utility trade, and nobody's pricing that in", "url": "https://x.com/BottomsApe/status/2113300811325567117"}, {"author_id": "1611906439521484801", "created_at": "2026-10-22T17:04:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113315658213765156"], "id": "2113315658213765156", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Analysts project a third of US data centers go fully off-grid by 2030. Behind-the-meter capacity is up 188% in five years. Grid interconnection still takes 3-7 years. They stopped waiting — they're building around it. Is your infrastructure still assuming a grid connection?", "url": "https://x.com/grantbmcdaniel/status/2113315658213765156"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2105720795343241216"]}, "author_id": "1453471240228786179", "created_at": "2026-10-23T19:05:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113708285652320500"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ZKmbNPUme8", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/nextthingtech/status/2113708285652320500/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2105720795343241216", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/ZKmbNPUme8"}]}, "id": "2113708285652320500", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A battery cell doesn't become commercial-ready overnight.\n\nOne of our biggest milestones was scaling our sodium-ion cell from 18 Ah to 70 Ah. 🔋\n\nThat's nearly 4× the capacity.\n\nWhy does that matter?\n\nBecause scaling a technology isn't just about making it work.\nIt's about making https://t.co/ZKmbNPUme8", "url": "https://x.com/nextthingtech/status/2113708285652320500"}, {"author_id": "25973977", "created_at": "2026-10-22T05:07:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113135200171594182"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Peak Energy Raises $108M to scale sodium-ion battery manufacturing and launch energy storage systems for data centres and grid demand.", "display_url": "ventureburn.com/peak-energy-ra…", "end": 78, "expanded_url": "https://ventureburn.com/peak-energy-raises-108-million-sodium-ion-storage/", "ima